Package: impro
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: LesToqz <214641162+LesToqz@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: git
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/LesToqz/impro
Description: IDE with explorer, editor, live Markdown notes and terminal docks
 impro is a GTK3 desktop IDE written in Rust. It combines a project
 explorer, a code editor, live Markdown notes, VTE terminal docks, a git
 graph with commit pages and a graph view of linked notes.
